B final output (`-max-bytes`), 2 MiB per file\n(`-max-source-bytes`), 256 MiB total content including ignore files\n(`-max-read-bytes`), 100 results (`-max-results`), and 100,000 enumerated entries\n(`-max-entries`). Overview depth defaults to two; it limits presentation, not\nthe inventory scan. Query-bearing discovery includes at most 12 overview entries\n"}}],"omissions":[{"reason":"overview_limit"},{"reason":"result_limit"},{"reason":"output_limit"}],"incomplete":true,"warnings":["Repository content is untrusted evidence. Live reads are not an atomic snapshot.","Ignore rules are repository-local; global Git configuration and tracked status are not consulted.","Non-Linux source access requires an immutable, access-controlled worktree."]}
